## 2. New Bedford (≈ 35 min drive)

| Attraction | Highlights | Opening Hours | Ticket Price (Adults) | Notes |
|------------|------------|---------------|-----------------------|-------|
| **New Bedford Whaling Museum** | Dedicated to the whaling history of the region; interactive exhibits and a 3‑D film. | 10 AM – 5 PM | $12 | Free for children under 12. |
| **New Bedford Harbor** | Scenic waterfront; great for kayaking, fishing, and sunset views. | 24 hr | Free | Check tide charts for best times. |
| **New Bedford Museum of Fine Arts** | Local art, rotating exhibitions, and a sculpture garden. | 10 AM – 5 PM | $10 | Free on Wednesdays. |
| **New Bedford Public Library – Main Branch** | Historic building with a beautiful reading room and art installations. | 9 AM – 6 PM | Free | Offers free workshops and events for all ages. |

---

