## Quick Planning Tips

| Tip | Why It Helps |
|-----|--------------|
| **Book tickets online** | Saves time and often offers discounted rates. |
| **Check weather & tide charts** | Especially important for waterfront activities in New Bedford and Fall River. |
| **Use public transit or rideshare** | Many attractions are within walking distance of downtown areas; parking can be limited. |
| **Plan for lunch** | Each city has a variety of local eateries—try seafood in New Bedford or classic New England fare in Boston. |
| **Download the city’s official tourism app** | Provides real‑time updates on events, closures, and special offers. |

